    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>将论文中绘制与插入图片流程说明如下：</p><p align="center">  <img src="https://github.com/DrHanks91/FileArchive/raw/main/Figures/figurePlotOrder.jpg" width="800"></p><p align="center">  绘图通用顺序</p><h1>步骤1: Matlab中绘图（可省略）</h1><p>在matlab中绘制线图、云图、柱状图和其他数据图，完成基本绘图即可。</p><p>完成绘图后，复制图片到内存中。</p><p align="center">  <img src="https://github.com/DrHanks91/FileArchive/raw/main/Figures/copyFigureInMaltab.gif" width="600"></p><p align="center">  Maltab绘图并复制到内存中</p>Matlab中示例代码如下：<figure class="highlight matlab"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">clc;clear all;close all;    <span class="comment">%% close all</span></span><br><span class="line">x = <span class="built_in">linspace</span>(<span class="number">-2</span>*<span class="built_in">pi</span>,<span class="number">2</span>*<span class="built_in">pi</span>);</span><br><span class="line">y1 = <span class="built_in">sin</span>(x);</span><br><span class="line">y2 = <span class="built_in">cos</span>(x);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">figure</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">plot</span>(x,y1,x,y2)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">%%</span></span><br><span class="line">xlabel(<span class="string">&#x27;X, unit&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">ylabel(<span class="string">&#x27;Y, unit&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">xlim([<span class="number">-7</span> <span class="number">7</span>])        <span class="comment">%% x range</span></span><br><span class="line">ylim([<span class="number">-1.2</span> <span class="number">1.2</span>])    <span class="comment">%% x range</span></span><br><span class="line">xticks(<span class="number">-6</span>:<span class="number">3</span>:<span class="number">6</span>)      <span class="comment">%% x ticks</span></span><br><span class="line">yticks(<span class="number">-1</span>:<span class="number">0.5</span>:<span class="number">1</span>)    <span class="comment">%% y ticks</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">xtickformat(<span class="string">&#x27;%.0f&#x27;</span>)    <span class="comment">%% x ticks</span></span><br><span class="line">ytickformat(<span class="string">&#x27;%.1f&#x27;</span>)    <span class="comment">%% y ticks</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>注意：二维图复制到内存时保存为矢量图；三维图复制到内存时改成了位图。</p><h1>步骤2: Illustrator中修改与排版</h1><p>修改模版大小为A4。可以将此A4模版放到文件夹中，或者下载<a href="https://github.com/DrHanks91/FileArchive/blob/main/Document/ai_A4_Template.ai">此文件模版（点击）</a>。</p><p>另存为文件，方便后续打开与修改。</p><h2 id="针对数据类修改：">针对数据类修改：</h2><p>空白处粘贴，并针对想要的内容做好修改，选中，导出文件到pdf。</p><p align="center">  <img src="https://github.com/DrHanks91/FileArchive/raw/main/Figures/ModifyFigureInIllustrator.gif" width="800"></p><p align="center">  Maltab图绘在Illustrator中修改</p><p>如果想要保证图片为A4文字页面的一半宽。A4纸张宽210mm，如实际页面宽（字面）为180,则宽度则为90mm。</p><p>可以使用Illstrator中的【Action】功能。事先录制，然后选中运行就行。如图中的action命令为【W-90】，具体执行步骤为：全选–宽度为90–字号为12–长比例为100%–宽比例为100%–再选中。同时指定的快捷键是：【Ctrl+F2】。因此可以实现，连续按多次【Ctrl+F2】可以快速调整图片格式，近似于90mm，且文字保持大小为12pt。</p><p align="center">  <img src="https://github.com/DrHanks91/FileArchive/raw/main/Figures/ModifyFigureInIllustratorHalf.gif" width="800"></p><p align="center">  在Illustrator中修改图片大小为90mm</p><h2 id="针对图片类、示意图类修改：">针对图片类、示意图类修改：</h2><p>将图片放到一个目标文件下，里面包含【.ai】文件和名为【links】的文件夹。其中，所有图片类文件均放到links下备用。此举有两个方便，一是可以方便整体拷贝，二是可以整体打包输出。</p><p>此处采用多图排版，并输出为180mm宽度为例说明：</p><p align="center">  <img src="https://github.com/DrHanks91/FileArchive/raw/main/Figures/ModifyFigureInIllustratorFull.gif" width="800"></p><p align="center">  在Illustrator中排版多图</p><h1>步骤3: 放到NCWU latex模版指定位置处</h1><p>如pdf图片文件为：文件名.pdf，将其放到NCWU latex模版指定位置处：</p><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">--NCWU latex 模版</span><br><span class="line">    --figures</span><br><span class="line">        --chapterX  X为章节号码</span><br><span class="line">            --文件名.pdf</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1>步骤4: latex中插入与编译</h1><p>以图片为1.0（占整个页宽）为例，插入图片应为：</p><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\includegraphics</span>[width=1.0<span class="keyword">\textwidth</span>]&#123;figures/chapter6/文件名.pdf&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>以图片为0.5（占半个页宽）为例，插入图片应为：</p><figure class="highlight latex"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">\includegraphics</span>[width=0.5<span class="keyword">\textwidth</span>]&#123;figures/chapter6/文件名.pdf&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>具体使用方法可以参考<a href="https://drhanks91.github.io/2025/12/26/%E6%AF%95%E8%AE%BE%E5%86%99%E4%BD%9C%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/">华北水利水电大学本科毕设latex模版</a>。</p><h1>步骤5: word中插入</h1><p>如果使用word模版，在第3步时，可以导出为bmp格式，或者jpg格式。</p><p>直接插入到word中即可。</p>]]>
    </content>
